{
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexstart.yarn-doorLockpick-4172": "锁着。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexstart.yarn-doorLockpick-4173": "ALVIN: 好了，亚历，看你的了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexstart.yarn-doorLockpick-4174": "ALEXANDRA: （嗯，是电子锁……旧型号。）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexstart.yarn-doorLockpick-4175": "ALEXANDRA: （先给控制器断电……再用电池给电机驱动器通一下电，然后……）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexstart.yarn-doorLockpick-4176": "ALEXANDRA: 开了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexstart.yarn-doorLockpick-4177": "ROBERT: 她很有一手。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexstart.yarn-doorLockpick-4178": "ALVIN: 我说什么来着？这可是家传的本事。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexstart.yarn-doorLockpick-4179": "ALVIN: 走。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexstart.yarn-doorLockpick-4180": "ALVIN: 你们搜左边，我搜右边，保安还有两小时才来。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexstart.yarn-doorLockpick-4181": "ALEXANDRA: 阿尔文！你不是说不会有人在吗！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexstart.yarn-doorLockpick-4182": "ALVIN: 按说不该有人，可总得小心点。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexstart.yarn-doorLockpick-4183": "ALVIN: 你盯好门口就行，好吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexstart.yarn-doorLockpick-4184": "ALEXANDRA: 阿尔文……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexstart.yarn-doorLockpick-4185": "ALEXANDRA: （真不敢相信，我居然在干这种事……）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexstart.yarn-doorLockpick-4186": "ALEXANDRA: （我们是为了妈妈，可……她要是知道我们在干什么……）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexstart.yarn-doorLockpick-4187": "ALEXANDRA: （要是怀疑到我们头上，店里的生意也受了影响呢？）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexstart.yarn-doorLockpick-4188": "ALEXANDRA: （可要是不干，我就付不起护士的钱……到时候又得把妈妈送回公立照护院……）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexstart.yarn-doorLockpick-4189": "ALVIN: 亚历！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexstart.yarn-doorLockpick-4190": "ALVIN: 亚历！！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexstart.yarn-doorLockpick-4191": "ALEXANDRA: 啊？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexstart.yarn-doorLockpick-4192": "ALEXANDRA: 他们……死了吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexstart.yarn-doorLockpick-4193": "ALVIN: 没有，别胡思乱想。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexstart.yarn-doorLockpick-4194": "ROBERT: 在这片街区偷点东西，警察才懒得管，可要是闹出人命……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexstart.yarn-doorLockpick-4195": "ALVIN: 总之，来帮我把他们绑上，罗伯特揍那个大个子的时候，把自己的手打骨折了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexstart.yarn-factoryInnerDoor-4196": "ALEXANDRA: 这种锁，我打不开。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexstart.yarn-factoryInnerDoor-4197": "ALVIN: 为什么？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexstart.yarn-factoryInnerDoor-4198": "ALEXANDRA: 这锁连着电源。装这么一套，可得花不少钱。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexstart.yarn-factoryInnerDoor-4199": "ALVIN: 那怎么办？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexstart.yarn-factoryInnerDoor-4200": "ALEXANDRA: 应该有个开门按钮。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexstart.yarn-factoryInnerDoor-4201": "ALVIN: 是吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexstart.yarn-factoryInnerDoor-4202": "ALVIN: 肯定在上面。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexstart.yarn-factoryInnerDoor-4203": "ALVIN: 得先下去，再绕过去。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexstart.yarn-factoryInnerDoor-4204": "ALEXANDRA: 得去按那个开关。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexstart.yarn-switchSceneWarehouse-4205": "ALEXANDRA: 就是这个面板，不过只有一直按着按钮，门才会开。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexstart.yarn-switchSceneWarehouse-4206": "ALVIN: 你怎么不早说……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexstart.yarn-switchSceneWarehouse-4207": "ALEXANDRA: 我看到才想到的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexstart.yarn-switchSceneWarehouse-4208": "ALVIN: 直接跳下去吧，这样快。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexstart.yarn-switchSceneWarehouse-4209": "ALVIN: 好了，亚历，开门。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexstart.yarn-switchSceneWarehouse-4210": "ALEXANDRA: （没有警报……应该没有吧？）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexstart.yarn-switchSceneWarehouse-4211": "ALVIN: 搞定，下来吧。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexstart.yarn-switchSceneWarehouse-4212": "ALEXANDRA: （我还是绕路走吧……）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexstart.yarn-switchSceneWarehouse-4213": "ALEXANDRA: 你、你从哪儿出来的？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexstart.yarn-switchSceneWarehouse-4214": "????: 他们刺伤我之后……我就一直在这里。他们……打了我个措手不及。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexstart.yarn-switchSceneWarehouse-4215": "????: 既然遮蔽已经失效……我恐怕也……撑不了多久了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexstart.yarn-switchSceneWarehouse-4216": "ALEXANDRA: 你是谁？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexstart.yarn-switchSceneWarehouse-4217": "????: 我是……这里的主人。我曾有过……一个帝国。就靠这些东西……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexstart.yarn-switchSceneWarehouse-4218": "????: 可现在，它们是你的了。它们选中了……你。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexstart.yarn-switchSceneWarehouse-4219": "ALEXANDRA: 你在流血，得去医院。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexstart.yarn-switchSceneWarehouse-4220": "????: 好让他们把我灭口……？不……过来。把这些拿走。不然布罗谢的手下可能会……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexstart.yarn-switchSceneWarehouse-4221": "????: 他们不知道……这些东西里面……藏着魔法……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexstart.yarn-switchSceneWarehouse-4222": "ALEXANDRA: 这是……纸牌？为什么——",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexstart.yarn-switchSceneWarehouse-4223": "<align=\"center\">（我……在哪里？）</align>",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexstart.yarn-switchSceneWarehouse-4224": "<align=\"center\">（什么？）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexstart.yarn-switchSceneWarehouse-4225": "ALEXANDRA: 什么！？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexstart.yarn-warehouseManager-4226": "MAN: ……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexstart.yarn-warehouseRejoin-4227": "ALVIN: 锁已经拆了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexstart.yarn-warehouseRejoin-4228": "ALVIN: 动作快点。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexstart.yarn-warehouseHearing-4229": "ALEXANDRA: 等等。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexstart.yarn-warehouseHearing-4230": "ALEXANDRA: 有人在这里。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexstart.yarn-warehouseHearing-4231": "ALVIN: 你怎么知道那里有人？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexstart.yarn-warehouseHearing-4232": "ALEXANDRA: 我听见他的靴子踩在水泥地上的声音了，你们听不见吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexstart.yarn-warehouseHearing-4233": "ALVIN: 得趁他没防备时动手……有帮手的话，也得一起打个措手不及。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexstart.yarn-warehouseReview-4234": "GANGSTER: 你们他妈是谁？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexstart.yarn-warehouseReview-4235": "ALVIN: 东西应该在左边房间。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexstart.yarn-warehouseReview-4236": "ALEXANDRA: 阿尔文，到底怎么回事？这些人是谁？你说过不用打架的！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexstart.yarn-warehouseReview-4237": "ALVIN: 别紧张，我看他们也是来偷东西的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexstart.yarn-warehouseReview-4238": "ROBERT: 难怪一直没拉警报。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexstart.yarn-warehouseReview-4239": "ALVIN: 走。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexstart.yarn-warehouseReview-4240": "ALVIN: 还有，别跟进来，这样你不知道我们拿了什么，他们就不能叫你去作证。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexstart.yarn-warehouseReview-4241": "ALEXANDRA: （以后再也不干了……阿尔文说什么都没用。）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexstart.yarn-warehouseReview-4242": "ALEXANDRA: （就算每天都得一个人给妈妈洗澡，我也认了……）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexstart.yarn-warehouseReview-4243": "ALEXANDRA: 嗯？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexstart.yarn-warehouseReview-4244": "ALEXANDRA: （又有人来了！得躲起来！）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexstart.yarn-warehouseReview-4245": "ALEXANDRA: （十八岁就会心脏病发作吗？）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexstart.yarn-warehouseReview-4246": "ALEXANDRA: 嗯？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexstart.yarn-warehouseReview-4247": "ALEXANDRA: 有……有人吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexstart.yarn-warehouseReview-4248": "ALEXANDRA: 这、这是什么……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexstart.yarn-warehouseReview-4249": "<align=\"center\">你……拥有……</align>",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexstart.yarn-warehouseReview-4250": "ALEXANDRA: 不、不要！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexstart.yarn-warehouseReview-4251": "ALVIN: 亚历，你在干什么？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexstart.yarn-warehouseReview-4252": "ALEXANDRA: 我在躲人……然后……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexstart.yarn-warehouseReview-4253": "ALVIN: 走了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexstart.yarn-warehouseReview-4254": "ENFORCER: 就这么闯进我们的地盘，你们想干什么？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexstart.yarn-warehouseReview-4255": "ALVIN: 我们不知道这里刚换了主人，这就走。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexstart.yarn-warehouseReview-4256": "ENFORCER: 对，没错，你们是该上路了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexstart.yarn-warehouseReview-4257": "ENFORCER: 老兄，你刚才是在给自己挖坟。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexstart.yarn-warehouseReview-4258": "ALVIN: 该走了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexstart.yarn-warehouseReview-4259": "ALEXANDRA: 又来了好多人。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexstart.yarn-warehouseReview-4260": "ALVIN: 你确定？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexstart.yarn-warehouseReview-4261": "ALEXANDRA: 你们听不见吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexstart.yarn-warehouseReview-4262": "ALEXANDRA: 刚开来几辆卡车。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexstart.yarn-warehouseReview-4263": "ALVIN: 我们要被困在里面了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexstart.yarn-warehouseReview-4264": "ALEXANDRA: 不！等等！这附近地板下面有个……呃，空的地方，一个空洞。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexstart.yarn-warehouseReview-4265": "ALEXANDRA: 这里。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexstart.yarn-warehouseReview-4266": "ALVIN: 你怎么……？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexstart.yarn-warehouseReview-4267": "ENFORCER: 他们在这边！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexstart.yarn-warehouseReview-4268": "ALVIN: 没别的路了，走！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexstart.yarn-warehouseReview-4269": "ALEXANDRA: （就不能等我一下吗？）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexstart.yarn-alvinGoesHome-4270": "ALVIN: 你该回家了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexstart.yarn-alvinGoesHome-4271": "ALEXANDRA: 他们都看见我们了，怎么办？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexstart.yarn-alvinGoesHome-4272": "ALVIN: 我去把货脱手，你回家看妈妈。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexstart.yarn-alvinGoesHome-4273": "ALEXANDRA: 阿尔文！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexstart.yarn-alvinGoesHome-4274": "ALVIN: 这阵子别过河，就不会有事。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexstart.yarn-alvinGoesHome-4275": "ALVIN: 他们不会来这边的，回家去。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexstart.yarn-alvinGoesHome-4276": "ALEXANDRA: （别这样丢下我一个人……）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexstart.yarn-alexSoloWarehouse-4277": "GANGSTER: 嘿，找到管事的——",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexstart.yarn-alexSoloWarehouse-4278": "GANGSTER: 等等，你他妈是谁？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexstart.yarn-alexSoloWarehouse-4279": "ALEXANDRA: （怎么……？）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexstart.yarn-soloAlexBattle-4280": "ALEXANDRA: （那个人的牌……自己飞到我手里来了？）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexstart.yarn-soloAlexBattle-4281": "GANGSTER: 什么玩意儿？刚才那是张纸牌！？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexstart.yarn-soloAlexBattle-4282": "GANGSTER: 什么……？打上去怎么跟砖墙一样？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexstart.yarn-louisAfterInit-4283": "LOUIS: 亚历，去睡吧。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexstart.yarn-louisAfterInit2-4284": "LOUIS: 亚历，去睡吧。"
}
